text 0 261 0 Selectable%20text%20is%20the%20return%20on%20doing%20layout%20from%20scratch.%20A%20paragraph%20broken%20into%20five%20lines%20is%20one%20paragraph;%20copying%20it%20must%20not%20freeze%20this%20column's%20width%20into%20the%20clipboard,%20because%20pasting%20that%20anywhere%20else%20shows%20the%20wrap%20points%20as%20ragged%20hard%20breaks.
text 0 261 1 Selectable%20text%20is%0Athe%20return%20on%20doing%20layout%20from%20scratch.%0AA%20paragraph%20broken%20into%20five%20lines%20is%20one%0Aparagraph;%20copying%20it%20must%20not%20freeze%0Athis%20column's%20width%20into%20the%20clipboard,%0Abecause%20pasting%20that%20anywhere%20else%0Ashows%20the%20wrap%20points%20as%20ragged%0Ahard%20breaks.
text 0 261 2 Selectable%20text%20is%0Athe%20return%20on%20doing%0Alayout%20from%20scratch.%0AA%20paragraph%20broken%0Ainto%20five%20lines%20is%20one%0Aparagraph;%20copying%0Ait%20must%20not%20freeze%0Athis%20column's%20width%0Ainto%20the%20clipboard,%0Abecause%20pasting%0Athat%20anywhere%20else%0Ashows%20the%20wrap%0Apoints%20as%20ragged%0Ahard%20breaks.
text 0 261 3 S%20electabl%09e%20text%20is%0At%20he%20return%09%20on%20doing%20l%20ayout%20fro%09m%20scratch.%0A%0AA%20%20paragra%09ph%20broken%0Ai%20nto%20five%20l%09ines%20is%20one%20p%20aragraph%09;%20copying%0A%0Ai%20t%20must%20n%09ot%20freeze%0At%20his%20colum%09n's%20width%20i%20nto%20the%20c%09lipboard,%0A%0Ab%20ecause%09pasting%0At%20hat%20anyw%09here%20else%20s%20hows%20t%09he%20wrap%0A%0Ap%20oints%20a%09s%20ragged%0Ah%20ard%20br%09eaks.
text 0 261 4 %E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87electable%20text%20is%20%20the%20return%20on%20doinx%0Alayout%20from%20scratch.A%20paragraph%20br%0Aken%09into%20five%20lines%20is%20one%20%20paragraph%C3%A9%20copying%09it%20must%20not%20freeze--this%20colu%C3%A9n's%20width%20into%20the%20clipboard,%09becaue%20pasting%0Athat%20anywhere%20else%20%20shows%20te%20wrappoints%20as%20ragged--hard%20breaks.
