text 0 261 0 Selectable%20text%20is%20the%20return%20on%20doing%20layout%20from%20scratch.%20A%20paragraph%20broken%20into%20five%20lines%20is%20one%20paragraph;%20copying%20it%20must%20not%20freeze%20this%20column's%20width%20into%20the%20clipboard,%20because%20pasting%20that%20anywhere%20else%20shows%20the%20wrap%20points%20as%20ragged%20hard%20breaks.
text 0 261 1 Selectable%20text%20is%0Athe%20return%20on%20doing%20layout%20from%0Ascratch.%20A%20paragraph%20broken%0Ainto%20five%20lines%20is%20one%20paragraph;%0Acopying%20it%20must%20not%20freeze%20this%0Acolumn's%20width%20into%20the%20clipboard,%0Abecause%20pasting%20that%20anywhere%20else%0Ashows%20the%20wrap%20points%20as%20ragged%0Ahard%20breaks.
text 0 261 2 Selectable%20text%20is%0Athe%20return%20on%20doing%0Alayout%20from%0Ascratch.%20A%0Aparagraph%20broken%0Ainto%20five%20lines%20is%0Aone%20paragraph;%0Acopying%20it%20must%20not%0Afreeze%20this%0Acolumn's%20width%20into%0Athe%20clipboard,%0Abecause%20pasting%0Athat%20anywhere%20else%0Ashows%20the%20wrap%0Apoints%20as%20ragged%0Ahard%20breaks.
text 0 261 3 S%20electabl%09e%20text%20is%0At%20he%20return%09%20on%20doing%20l%20ayout%09%20from%0A%0As%20crat%09ch.%20A%0Ap%20aragrap%09h%20broken%20i%20nto%20five%09%20lines%20is%0A%0Ao%20ne%20par%09agraph;%0Ac%20opying%20it%09%20must%20not%20f%20reeze%09%20this%0A%0Ac%20olumn's%20w%09idth%20into%0At%20he%20cli%09pboard,%20b%20ecause%09pasting%0A%0At%20hat%20anyw%09here%20else%0As%20hows%20t%09he%20wrap%20p%20oints%20a%09s%20ragged%0A%0Ah%20ard%20br%09eaks.
text 0 261 4 x%20electable%20text%20is%20%0Athe%20return%20on%20doin%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87--layout%20from%09scratch.%20A%0Aparagraph%20brabken--into%20five%20lines%20isone%20paragraphab%09copying%20it%20must%20not%20%0Afreeze%20this%20%20coluabn's%20width%20into%20%0Athe%20clipboard,%20%0Abecauabe%20pasting%09that%20anywhere%20else%0Ashows%20t%0Ae%20wrap%09points%20as%20ragged%0Ahard%20breaks.
