text 0 277 0 Selectable%20text%20is%20the%20return%20on%20doing%20layout%20from%20scratch.%20A%20paragraph%20broken%20into%20five%20lines%20is%20one%20paragraph;%20copying%20it%20must%20not%20freeze%20this%20column's%20width%20into%20the%20clipboard,%20because%20pasting%20that%20anywhere%20else%20shows%20the%20wrap%20points%20as%20ragged%20hard%20breaks.
text 0 277 1 Selectable%20text%20is%0Athe%20return%20on%20doing%20layout%20from%0Ascratch.%20A%20paragraph%20broken%0Ainto%20five%20lines%20is%20one%20paragraph;%0Acopying%20it%20must%20not%20freeze%20this%0Acolumn's%20width%20into%20the%20clipboard,%0Abecause%20pasting%20that%20anywhere%20else%0Ashows%20the%20wrap%20points%20as%20ragged%0Ahard%20breaks.
text 0 277 2 Selectable%20text%20is%0Athe%20return%20on%20doing%0Alayout%20from%0Ascratch.%20A%0Aparagraph%20broken%0Ainto%20five%20lines%20is%0Aone%20paragraph;%0Acopying%20it%20must%20not%0Afreeze%20this%0Acolumn's%20width%20into%0Athe%20clipboard,%0Abecause%20pasting%0Athat%20anywhere%20else%0Ashows%20the%20wrap%0Apoints%20as%20ragged%0Ahard%20breaks.
text 0 277 3 Selectabl%09e%20text%20is%0Athe%20retur%09n%20on%20doing%20layou%09t%20from%0A%0Ascrat%09ch.%20A%0Aparagrap%09h%20broken%20into%20five%09%20lines%20is%0A%0Aone%20par%09agraph;%0Acopying%20i%09t%20must%20not%20freez%09e%20this%0A%0Acolumn's%09width%20into%0Athe%20cli%09pboard,%20because%09%20pasting%0A%0Athat%20anyw%09here%20else%0Ashows%20t%09he%20wrap%20points%20a%09s%20ragged%0A%0Ahard%20b%09reaks.
text 0 277 4 %C3%A9electable%20text%20is%20%20the%20return%20on%20doinlayout%20fromscratch.%20A%20%0Aparagraph%20br%20ken%20into%20five%20lines%20is%0Aone%20paragraph%0Acopying%20it%20must%20not%09freeze%20this--colun's%20width%20into%20%0Athe%20clipboard,--becaue%20pasting--that%20anywhere%20else%0Ashows%20tabe%20wrappoints%20as%20ragged%20hard%20breaks.
