text 0 277 4 %E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87electable%20text%20is%0Athe%20return%20on%20doin%C3%A9%20%20layout%20from%0Ascratch.%20A%20paragraph%20brken%20%0Ainto%20five%20lines%20isone%20paragraphx--copying%20it%20must%20not%09freeze%20this%20%0Acolu%C3%A9n's%20width%20into%20the%20clipboard,%20becaux%20e%20pasting%20that%20anywhere%20else%20%20shows%20t%20e%20wrap%09points%20as%20ragged--hard%20breaks.
