text 0 268 0 Selectable%20text%20is%20the%20return%20on%20doing%20layout%20from%20scratch.%20A%20paragraph%20broken%20into%20five%20lines%20is%20one%20paragraph;%20copying%20it%20must%20not%20freeze%20this%20column's%20width%20into%20the%20clipboard,%20because%20pasting%20that%20anywhere%20else%20shows%20the%20wrap%20points%20as%20ragged%20hard%20breaks.
